		</disallowedRaidAgeRestrictions>
		<dialogFactionGreetingHostile>The Brotherhood remembers every trespass.</dialogFactionGreetingHostile>
		<dialogFactionGreetingWary>You speak to Nod. Choose faith, tribute, or silence.</dialogFactionGreetingWary>
		<dialogFactionGreetingWarm>Kane watches over those who understand the future.</dialogFactionGreetingWarm>
		<dialogMilitaryAidSent>Nod will send a detachment. Do not waste their devotion.</dialogMilitaryAidSent>
